<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian 91-day T-bill rate drops further.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian 91-day T-bill rate drops further.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on 91-day Lithuanian Treasury bills eased to 9.46 percent on Tuesday versus 10.42 percent at last week's sale of 97-day paper, the central bank said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of litas.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YIELD   (LAST WEEK)   ISSUE   BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 91-day	9.46	  10.42	  50     96.4   50</p>
<p>The settlement date for today's auction is December 6, and the bills mature on March 7.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
